# Only needed for local dev, and only if the standalone token server (src/tokenServer.ts) runs
# on a port other than the default 8080 (i.e. you changed TOKEN_SERVER_PORT at the repo root).
# vite.config.ts proxies /api/connection-details to this URL during `vite dev`; the app code
# itself never reads this variable directly.
#
# Not used in production: on Vercel, the frontend calls its own same-origin serverless function
# at api/connection-details.ts instead. Set LIVEKIT_URL / LIVEKIT_API_KEY / LIVEKIT_API_SECRET as
# Vercel Environment Variables (not this one) for that function to work.
VITE_TOKEN_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:8080
